{"job_id":"F-24f3aac6db959b1d3984","family_id":"F-24f3aac6db959b1d3984","title":"대법원 윤리감사관과 그 보좌기관 및 분장사무에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":31,"target_id":"79dc3490c3f1ce06d453e33585eb96405daa96111ba96d9ce5ee1a5981aafba2","source_hash":"ca5ddd44f610bf623e88772165e2189705696ea09806f6321cd6a8cb04af48cf","text":"关于最高法院道德审计员、支持机构和职责分配的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":90,"target_id":"c3759f0e0f1f849ba149ab4a7f1b8b85ccda610d888e8c5bae47d34916af08bf","source_hash":"7146c5548fb8663fb92030fda8e61767e6115f2a2a6a0e3293ed6866920b8614","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定最高法院道德监督员的地位、道德监督员的辅助机构以及根据法院组织法第71条之2第1款分配的职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":90,"end":258,"target_id":"06e3dcfa56f5ff403b92a846d56b0e3c5bbdb313d76b42a965b7cf377bd7fded","source_hash":"1fb5a3237dbaf24f63fa737d7a9e599ff8b399132e54bc9193dca0a99c603564","text":"第二条（道德审计员）\n① 道德审计员在最高法院首席大法官的指导下，监督法院审计事务（但“根据法院司法事务处理规则第5条进行的有关司法事务等的审计”除外）以及法官和法院官员的公职道德事务。\n道德审计员应由政治任命人员担任，其薪酬应与副部长相同。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":258,"end":460,"target_id":"eeff689d0d872df4f908c162fcd2cf59f3fc212d2f17af8c6a478bda2a376afc","source_hash":"938a5489b8dab43e82a63e8572760ad5b0b4adf7eeea9fa9e802c3b8da4a754d","text":"第三条（咨询机构和职责分配）\n① 可任命审议员或主管人员协助道德审计员，其职称和职责按附表规定执行。\n② 如果道德审计员因不可避免的情况缺席或无法履行其职责，则道德审计首席审议员应行使职权。\n③ 道德审计首席审议官应由法官担任，道德审计审议官应由法官、法院院长或法院副院长担任。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":460,"end":538,"target_id":"52cef5239c01498209891c49c1d6f9be55dffc463bbecf018fc4b51ebd2eb364","source_hash":"4fe9d1e23a79d1065dcd4f8bb294d0dfa0673c3e563d8a335e64653f94821823","text":"第四条（保密义务）道德审计员、附属工作人员以及曾担任过此类职务的人员不得泄露在履行各自职责过程中获悉的信息。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":538,"end":588,"target_id":"1d5a9e44ca558cfb7cab6cdb1fe4012c27fa510f9026e14b37774a843d12cc14","source_hash":"1749c350bdfec1fcf665e56f658e4d130ca80b7c1921d2c64f09e16a70a41413","text":"补充规定 <第2954号，2021年1月29日>\n\n该规定自2021年2月9日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"BODY","start":588,"end":2361,"target_id":"0465378be5f0678f6cb4ca089aa2bb247eb4127dde58f42ac116da4846fd8706","source_hash":"adc75f1df47c9979f8339e1594b61afd43adaff601e5b911dd020d7166aeaf5b","text":"补充规定 <第3162号，2024年8月29日>\n\n本规则自公布之日起生效，但自2024年3月1日起适用。\n\n最高法院道德审计员及支持机构职责表\n■ 最高法院道德审计员、支持组织和职责分配规则 [附表] <2024年8月29日修订>   \n\n  最高法院道德审计员及其支持机构职责表                                              \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃标题 │化妆师 ┃\n\n┠─────┬─────┼───────────────────────────────┨\n\n┃윤리감사관│윤리감사  │ 윤리감사관 업무 보좌                                         ┃\n\n┃          │총괄심의관│                                                              ┃\n\n┃          ├─────┼───────────────────────────────┨\n\n┃          │윤리감사  │ 1. 법관에 대한 징계에 관한 사항                              ┃\n\n┃ │第一高级审稿人 │ 2. 法官不当行为调查（针对法官的投诉）┃\n\n┃ │ │（包括道德审计员指定的申诉案件的处理）┃\n\n┃          │          │ 3. 법관윤리에 관한 사항                                      ┃\n\n┃          │          │ 4. 윤리감사관이 지정한 업무                                  ┃\n\n┃          ├─────┼───────────────────────────────┨\n\n┃          │윤리감사  │ 1. 법관 및 법원직원의 재산등록에 관한 사항                   ┃\n\n┃          │제1담당관 │ 2. 퇴직공직자 취업제한 등에 관한 사항                        ┃\n\n┃          │          │ 3. 법관에 대한 진정·청원의 처리                             ┃\n\n┃          ├─────┼───────────────────────────────┨\n\n┃          │윤리감사  │ 1. 법원직원, 집행관, 법무사 등에 대한 진정 및 비위           ┃\n\n┃          │제2심의관 │사항의 조사처리와 그 요인분석                                 ┃\n\n┃          │          │ 2. 법원직원에 대한 징계에 관한 사항                          ┃\n\n┃          │          │ 3. 부패방지 및 청탁금지에 관한 사항                          ┃\n\n┃ │ │ 4. 一般行政审计（不包括由最高法院法官担任审计员的行政审计），┃\n\n┃ │ │首席大法官特别命令进行的专项审计、服务审计和其他审计 ┃\n\n┃          │          │사의 계획, 집행 및 그 밖의 사항의 처리                        ┃\n\n"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00001","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847345","source_hash":"5259b469e539dd99c07f57b1c0d0887bb0897610cb707b36faee25f173442063","text":"■ 最高法院道德审计员、支持机构和职责分配规则 [附表] <2024年8月29日修订>"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00002","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847346","source_hash":"fe486098ad97fa99f849ef3cd5cda94741aec7fd2001e886c26aa9d57330b0ca","text":"最高法院道德审计员及其支持机构的职责表"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00003","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847347","source_hash":"50e17285d2a63a98ea465a20a4272e72fbd3216d75eec4265192925ea90ab9af","text":"名称"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00004","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847348","source_hash":"ffdc5e5e5ad23272cc713e9790df6dff1c0013d783c5674806e24bb20b6b5cb0","text":"化妆办公室"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00005","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847349","source_hash":"c5b5c735180b7ce2f5a55ba923e5e82869c443d936fca0cfc3a74f90ec041ec9","text":"道德审计员"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00006","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847351","source_hash":"32f33f601a91ae40c2649f67b4d645db928d6b9b89fa92114f5d1f5070930b3a","text":"协助道德审计员"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00007","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847352","source_hash":"c57f8301c453f9ed35807137856b364c417e7f845fe863e5cffd3005195d3c18","text":"普通审查官"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00008","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847354","source_hash":"3fccf8b675b4d5adc494a8b1e1ea3a8fd96209de1c8a0a2d0607fdbaba8f6ca3","text":"1. 关于对法官采取纪律处分的事项"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00009","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847355","source_hash":"a255417a8118b5da29e926978aca8a90927d8dcebb4c3967be43b18c122afe05","text":"First 高级审议官"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00010","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847356","source_hash":"ce97800c0a2d74eb26e74a4d0ed65e1185663a8c110a2f6febe26d5a9f66ef44","text":"2. 对法官不当行为的调查（针对法官的投诉·"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00011","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847357","source_hash":"cc2cb52ffc534270e4af7a4ef6be4871ebe9d96f8be183ab5186a2bd67cac6ef","text":"（包括道德审计员指定的申诉案件的处理）"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00012","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847358","source_hash":"a9e87401258c5d2507220d10a2a16f1c125632d24624c626784d9cefd2d6500b","text":"3. 关于司法伦理的事项"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00013","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847359","source_hash":"198ca0e6e70cc28193e6fb846c3aa08dc2472eb1c7573dab3b420924a8197dba","text":"4. 道德审计员指定的职责"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00014","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847361","source_hash":"94e12609936d84ff951048e305110f7cba725225e37611761b66325473cdc5e0","text":"1. 关于法官和法院工作人员资产登记的事项"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00015","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847362","source_hash":"a53e588f23491f56ea9e1a7a0f4b4b639fd84e165711be193fa00f872c4a4ae2","text":"副驾驶"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00016","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847363","source_hash":"7a7cf4800bec24331007bd0fe5e8bdf332fe3fa3d42ec4ca4ed59eb62f5f85e4","text":"2. 关于退休公职人员就业限制等事宜"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00017","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847364","source_hash":"821e50bc218a0fb61c3ea53343dbe53374e5ae13ba50fee80d5fc79e4bb38780","text":"3. 向法官提交请愿书和投诉的处理"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00018","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847366","source_hash":"13b2ecee70e65ffdd79651d22ef27d42f6236e8f31478cd9756f4d93756cbb02","text":"1. 关于法院工作人员、法警、法律文书员等的请愿和不当行为。"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00019","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847367","source_hash":"0d0d53080dbe0cd8b5b8f2f0fe479037597c1a50cd88053fda1433347584d7ee","text":"第二审议官"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00020","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847369","source_hash":"86608f71d9d364d5739ddca4e88e6b2a43c1616d4ac319d7d18015adab57cce3","text":"2. 关于对法院工作人员采取纪律处分的事项"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00021","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847370","source_hash":"c054f5239fe50f8baab4b2d1409b474e556208838845159d61fceab235575746","text":"3. 关于防止腐败和禁止索取的事项"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00022","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847371","source_hash":"c6643ad3be70b6cf50202f92d969e1f53f8e85b52947f27c6de813481225bd40","text":"4. 一般行政审计（不包括由最高法院法官担任审计员的行政审计），"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00023","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847372","source_hash":"04b57f0df93547f4e95b11bdd55addec8826675a7560580eb900f810ab5c466f","text":"最高法院首席大法官特别下令进行的特定审计、服务审计和其他审计"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00024","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847373","source_hash":"60751d1a4b03e81719d3396b6a6d0b80aeebadc82cce3a1391d7bd2bf7a74771","text":"公司其他事务的规划、执行和处理"},{"id":"A39193-zh-00025","doc":"A39193","law_id":"kr-014009-265117-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2847374","source_hash":"133b687c2df4590cfd31dd6ea1063a092eacf2c675c8e007783c5bb28ccd1f85","text":"5. 关于会计审计的事项"}]}